  "id": "fig-01",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Two unlettered representations of planes, alpha by a parallelogram and beta by an arbitrary closed footprint. Chosen modern projection/regularization, no source measurements or added points.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-01.png",
      "sha256": "13076830720afe711c4f86b62eee075cb8e648af6cd9cd85f6ad3dd6172179b0"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n1",
        "text": "立体几何有四个基本概念：点、直线、平面和距离.\n不仅在几何中，而且在其他所有数学分支中，“集合”也被作为不加定义的基本概念.\n\n在几何中，任何点的集合都称为图形.\n直线和平面都是图形的例子."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n1",
        "text": "画图时，可以用平行四边形或其他任意的平面图形表示平面（图 1）.\n平面通常用希腊字母 $\\alpha$、$\\beta$、$\\gamma$ 等表示.\n点和直线沿用平面几何中的常用记法：点记为 $A$、$B$、$C$、…，直线记为 $a$、$b$、$c$、…，也可记为 $(AB)$、$(AC)$ 等."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
